  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "以桌面角色扮演为根基自由拼装多种力量，让角色构筑而非单次骰运决定结果",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Within the game's realm, you have the freedom to assemble an array of powers, drawing inspiration from a build system rooted in tabletop role-playing games. ・Fantasy Adventure Embark on a breathtaking fantasy odyssey, blending the allure of rogue elements with the strategic depth of tabletop role-playing adventures. success or failure hinges not merely on the roll of the dice but on the myriad abilities your character possesses. Your fate is not solely dictated by chance; rather, it is shaped by your character's prowess, allowing you to wield various abilities to alter outcomes and carve your own destiny.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2919560/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "特定敌人与场景会解锁专属战斗交互，可谈判招募、断尾、反射石化或念出真名驱魔",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Moreover, numerous \"interactive actions\" are unlocked only when facing specific enemies or encountering particular scenarios. These interactive actions, referred to as \"combat interactions,\" include: ·Engaging in dialogue with sentient adversaries, potentially ending the conflict peacefully or even recruiting them as new allies.· ·Employing a \"tail severing\" maneuver to neutralize a foe's formidable appendage. ·Exploiting an enemy's petrifying gaze to one's advantage, potentially inducing self-petrification through mirrored reflection. ·Unveiling a demon's true name through \"knowledge,\" then utilizing \"chanting\" to vanquish or weaken it.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2919560/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "除战棋外还设辩论战与军团战，分别管理反驳社交检定以及军队训练和士气",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The game harbors additional combat systems: · For instance, there's the nuanced \"debate warfare,\" which involves managing counterarguments and social skill checks to simulate a debate scenario. · Additionally, there's the imperative of cultivating armies and sustaining morale in the realm of \"military combat,\" necessitating ongoing attention to training and morale outside of the battlefield.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2919560/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
